e package build, and all 82 passed again at 8ebaf237c4 after the post-merge rebuild. (7) ESLint, narrowed: eslint --no-inline-config --format json packages/spec/src/migrations/registry.ts gave files 1, errors 0, warnings 0 at 8ebaf237c4. Population: eslint.config.mjs files glob **/*.{ts,tsx,mts,cts,js,jsx,mjs,cjs}. Invariance: eslint.config.mjs:326-328 states it never enables type-aware linting, so this diff cannot change the verdict on an untouched file. The .changeset .md is not in the glob. (8) check:nul-bytes exit 0 (in the derived set). Control-byte grep over both changed files exited 1 (no match), captured before any pipe. (9) Local dry runs of the PR-body gates on the body as sent: check-partof-closing-keyword exit 0; check-changeset-no-major --base dff98c1f51 --event exit 0. (10) check-governed-merges --branch: NOT governed (0 of 2 paths hit the register), 41 changed lines, under 5000.",
